  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced. Cut potato into fries.\n• Place on lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, sprinkle with all-purpose seasoning, season with salt and toss to coat.\n• Bake until tender, 20-25 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-670773ea10eac7b3edfece55-24b79cc4.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, thinly slice tomato into rounds. Drain sweetcorn. Grate carrot and squeeze out any excess moisture using a paper towel.\n• In a medium bowl, combine corn, carrot, Cheddar cheese, garlic seasoning, the plain flour, egg, milk and a good pinch of salt and pepper (if it's too wet, add more flour).",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-670773ea10eac7b3edfece55-1f893112.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Heat a large frying pan over medium-high heat with enough olive oil to coat the base.\n• When oil is hot, cook heaped spoonfuls of fritter mixture in batches, flattening with a spatula, until golden, 3-4 mins each side (don't flip too early!). You should get 2-3 fritters per person.\n• Transfer to a paper towel-lined plate.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-670773ea10eac7b3edfece55-6c21bde7.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, halve continental rolls and bake directly on a wire oven rack until heated through, 2-3 mins.\n• Spread rolls with some garlic aioli. Top with tomato, fritters and onion chutney.\n• Serve with fries and remaining aioli.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-670773ea10eac7b3edfece55-b5d3725e.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
